  "solution": {
    "text": "$B_{2}=5+5=10 e^{-}$\r\n$$\r\n=\\sigma 1 s^{2} \\dot{\\sigma} 1 s^{2}, \\sigma 2 s^{2} \\dot{\\sigma} 2 s^{2}, \\pi 2 p_{x}^{1}, \\pi 2 p_{y}^{\\prime}\r\n$$\r\nDue to the presence of 2 unpaired electrons, in $\\pi$ bonding orbitals, $B_{2}$ shows paramagnetic behaviour."
